      "id": "sol.amc-8-1988-p2.live",
      "kind": "proof-sketch",
      "text": "Write the decimals as fractions: \\(8 \\times \\dfrac14 \\times 2 \\times \\dfrac18.\\)\n\nGrouping, \\(\\left(8 \\times \\dfrac18\\right)\\left(\\dfrac14 \\times 2\\right)\\) \\(= 1 \\times \\dfrac12\\) \\(= \\dfrac12.\\)\n\nThus, the correct answer is C .",
      "hints": [
        "Rewrite the decimals as fractions: \\(0.25 = \\dfrac14\\) and \\(0.125 = \\dfrac18\\)",
        "Pair \\(8 \\times \\dfrac18\\) and \\(\\dfrac14 \\times 2\\) to simplify"
      ],
